{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12214170","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12214170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1221417001:1":{"text":"卡尔，听好，这是我教给你的最后一课。","source_cn":"卡尔，听好，这是我教给你的最后一课。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBDFBAD9E4794822","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1221417002:1":{"text":"最后一课就是……不要给别人乱起外号啊！我叫满满！","source_cn":"最后一课就是……不要给别人乱起外号啊！我叫满满！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96F454FC7CD4DA6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221417003:1":{"text":"对不起！仓、啊不！满满老师！","source_cn":"对不起！仓、啊不！满满老师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x984EA0DD4AF5E8A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221417004:1":{"text":"卡尔，这是刚才卖掉配方的钱，拿着吧，就当是我作为“战斗老师”的一点心意。","source_cn":"卡尔，这是刚才卖掉配方的钱，拿着吧，就当是我作为“战斗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F62F281FE5877BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221417005:1":{"text":"不！老师教我变强，我还没付学费，我不能收钱！","source_cn":"不！老师教我变强，我还没付学费，我不能收钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EC8CE819797A637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_st